{
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "fare_breakdown charges a cancellation fee of SGD 6.00 and nothing else — no base fare, no platform fee, no waiting-time fee — and SGD 6.00 is exactly what fee_schedule.resolution_rule produces for this trip: the greater of the AIRPORT zone-class fee (SGD 6.00) and the RYDE_X vehicle-tier fee (SGD 4.00). POL-NS-08(d) is therefore not engaged, and this artifact is COMPLETE at weight 1.0, with refund_issued_sgd of 0.00 and payment_status PENDING.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-00210"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-08"],
      "relies_on": "derived.money.fee_charged",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "POL-NS-01 limbs (a) and (d) are satisfied on the trip record: it carries a driver 'arrived' event for this trip and it shows the driver terminating at 23:49:05 under cancellation_reason_code RIDER_NO_SHOW, one of the three codes limb (d) recognises. I disclose that EV-TRIP-00210 is IMPAIRED at weight 0.4 with issue code CROSS_SOURCE_CONFLICT; that conflict concerns the arrived timestamp and the implied wait, not the existence of the arrived event or the reason code, which are internal to the record.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-TRIP-00210"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-01"],
      "relies_on": "payload.cancellation_reason_code",
      "asserted_weight": 0.4
    },
    {
      "text": "The proximity test in POL-NS-02 is met on the trace's own measurements: the driver's track closes to 96.0 m from the pickup pin, inside the 150 m arrival radius fee_schedule fixes for the AIRPORT zone class, and the derived arrival block counts 5 qualifying in-geofence fixes. I disclose that EV-GPS-00210 is IMPAIRED at weight 0.25 with issue codes CLOCK_SKEW, GPS_GAP, LOW_COVERAGE, TRUNCATED_LOG, LOW_SAMPLE_RATE and PARTIAL_RECORD; the impairment goes to timing and coverage, while proximity is a measured distance rather than an inference.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-00210"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-02"],
      "relies_on": "derived.driver_track.min_distance_m",
      "asserted_weight": 0.25
    },
    {
      "text": "The rider's shortfall case under POL-NS-06 cannot be carried by this trace. The longest continuous qualifying run the derived facts report is 255 seconds against a 480 second AIRPORT minimum, but the same artifact runs 228 seconds ahead of the server clock — far over the 90 second limb (a) threshold in POL-NS-08 — loses a 186.0 second sampling gap from 23:39:15 to 23:42:21 straight across the moment of geofence entry, and stops 149 seconds before the cancellation. Because the deciding fact of dwell rests on a single artifact impaired under POL-NS-08(a) and (b), that artifact cannot alone support a ruling against the driver, and the shortfall is not proved.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-00210"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-08", "POL-NS-06"],
      "relies_on": "derived.arrival.longest_qualifying_run.duration_sec",
      "asserted_weight": 0.25
    },
    {
      "text": "Read with the clock skew the pre-pass itself identified, the first qualifying in-geofence fix falls at 23:38:33 server time and the dwell running to the 23:49:05 cancellation is 632 seconds, comfortably past the 480 second AIRPORT minimum POL-NS-01 limb (c) requires. The face-value 404 seconds and the corrected 632 seconds differ only by that 228 second device skew, and the 186 second gap conceals which is right; what the artifact cannot do is affirmatively establish the shorter figure, which is the one the rider needs.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-00210"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-01", "POL-NS-08"],
      "relies_on": "derived.arrival.longest_qualifying_run.first_ts",
      "asserted_weight": 0.25
    },
    {
      "text": "If the corrected reading governs, the fee stands and nothing from POL-NS-03 to POL-NS-06 displaces it: the driver's fixes sit inside the AIRPORT arrival radius so POL-NS-03's wrong-entrance route is not engaged, POL-NS-05 cannot be run while a 228 second skew makes the arrival marker unmatchable to any fix, and the rider's only logged message postdates the cancellation so POL-NS-04 grants no exoneration.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-00210", "EV-CHAT-00210", "EV-TRIP-00210"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-01", "POL-NS-03", "POL-NS-04", "POL-NS-05"]
    },
    {
      "text": "On that footing POL-NS-07 entitles the driver to 80 percent of the SGD 6.00 fee, namely SGD 4.80, with the SGD 1.20 residual retained as the platform service fee.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-00210"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-07"],
      "relies_on": "derived.money.driver_compensation",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The POL-NS-07 anti-farming check does not trip and compensation cannot be withheld: driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d is 2, below the threshold of 4, and 2 divided by completed_trips_30d of 156 is 0.013, below the 0.08 rate limb. Both limbs must hold, and I cite these two fields only for the test POL-NS-07 names, as POL-GEN-01 requires.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-DPROF-00210"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-07", "POL-GEN-01"],
      "relies_on": "payload.no_show_terminations_30d",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The record cannot settle this dispute, and the tribunal should say so rather than refund it. The trip record's arrived_at of 23:42:10 and its implied 6.9 minute wait cannot be reconciled with a trace whose device stamps run 228 seconds ahead and whose coverage of the entry moment is missing; POL-NS-09(b) is engaged by that direct contradiction on arrival and dwell, POL-NS-09(e) by the sole deciding artifact being impaired under POL-NS-08(a) and (b), and confidence is in any event capped at 0.25 by POL-GEN-02(2), below the 0.70 floor. Escalation holds the SGD 6.00 rather than refunding it, which is the correct outcome while the conflict stands.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-TRIP-00210", "EV-GPS-00210"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-09", "POL-GEN-02"],
      "asserted_weight": 0.25
    },
    {
      "text": "The rider's exoneration route under POL-NS-04 fails. The only rider message in the log is 'why cancel?? i was at door 6', sent at 23:49:40 — 35 seconds after the driver terminated the trip at 23:49:05 — so it is not a locating or coordinating message 'during the waiting window' as limb (a) requires; and limb (c) cannot be run at all, because the trace carries no rider_track, which makes the rider's position within the 200 m AIRPORT presence radius undecidable and neutral rather than established. I disclose that EV-CHAT-00210 is IMPAIRED at weight 0.6 with issue code TRUNCATED_LOG, and the messages missing from that export are precisely the ones the rider would need.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-CHAT-00210", "EV-GPS-00210", "EV-TRIP-00210"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-04", "POL-NS-08"],
      "asserted_weight": 0.6
    },
    {
      "text": "POL-NS-05's false-arrival test cannot be run on this bundle, and the clause says so itself: where clock skew between the trip record and the trace exceeds 90 seconds, matching the arrival event to a GPS fix is unsafe and POL-NS-08(a) applies before POL-NS-05 can be reached. The skew here is 228 seconds, so no false-arrival finding may be entered against this driver and no such referral belongs in the ruling. I disclose that EV-GPS-00210 is IMPAIRED at weight 0.25 with issue code CLOCK_SKEW among others.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-00210", "EV-TRIP-00210"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-05", "POL-NS-08"],
      "relies_on": "derived.arrival.arrived_at",
      "asserted_weight": 0.25
    },
    {
      "text": "POL-NS-03 is not the operative clause. Its 400 m ceiling governs only where the driver was stationary outside the POL-NS-02 arrival radius; the derived distances put this driver inside the 150 m AIRPORT radius at qualifying fixes, so this is not a wrong-face-of-the-same-venue case and neither the limb (i) nor the limb (ii) fault allocation arises. The pickup pin also carries venue_id null, so no venue match or mismatch can be established either way.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-00210", "EV-TRIP-00210"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-03"],
      "relies_on": "derived.arrival.qualifying_fix_count",
      "asserted_weight": 0.25
    },
